==Strategy==
Metal Hippoe is not a strong pusher and has low HP for a metal enemy, so it's best to NOT bring a crit unit so you can abuse it as a stepping stone for LD attackers. Units with large piercing range work best which mostly consists of Ubers but just about any will work.

[[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]] is the best meatshield to use as it stalls Crocodylidae Kurocroc indefinitely when Bore Jr. and Wild Doge aren't bothering your Cats. As such you should have counters to use on reaction to these two such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Watch out for Croakley when spawning any non [[Immune to Slow|Slow Immune]] units as Cat limit is a major concern.
It will be a long stage so don't expect it to go fast. Be patient and you'll win.

